{"step_index":65,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T02:53:28Z","thinking":"The backend API is functioning correctly, providing necessary employee data. Now, the focus shifts to building the frontend application. Initial components will include an API client module for data interaction and an application context for managing dark/light mode preferences, persisting the state to local storage.\n\n\nFocus is now on defining the application's core state and UI components. The application state will manage active page, real-time clock, date selection, and data related to employees, tasks, Gantt items, and notifications, including loading indicators. The layout components, including header, sidebar, and toast notifications, are being analyzed to establish UI structure and functionality.\n\n\nAnalyzing UI components for the HR and Tasks pages to define data presentation and user interactions. The HR page will feature KPI cards, an action bar for searching and adding employees, a modal for employee creation, and a personnel grid displaying employee information and status with quick actions. The Tasks page utilizes tab navigation, a form for task creation including project, phase, and assigned personnel, with a list/board view showing tasks by employee.\n\n\nDefining task status indicators and progress update mechanisms is underway, including visual cues for timely, early, or delayed completion. Implementing Overtime (OT) registration forms and modal functionalities, allowing for urgent task selection, personnel assignment, hour specification, justification, and approval routing. Developing a Gantt chart component, modeling a realistic user view with project selection, adding/creating project functionalities, zoom controls, and phase filters. The Gantt chart component is also being split into a frozen data table and an interactive chart for task management.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * API Client kết nối với Backend Express (http://localhost:5000/api)\n * Đã cấu hình fallback dữ liệu dự phòng tự động nếu Backend tạm thời chưa khởi động.\n */\n\nconst API_BASE = 'http://localhost:5000/api';\n\n// Hàm gửi request tiện ích\nasync function fetchApi(endpoint, options = {}) {\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch(`${API_BASE}${endpoint}`, {\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n        ...options.headers,\n      },\n      ...options,\n    });\n    if (!res.ok) {\n      const err = await res.json().catch(() => ({ message: 'Lỗi máy chủ' }));\n      throw new Error(err.message || `Lỗi HTTP ${res.status}`);\n    }\n    return await res.json();\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.warn(`[API] Gọi ${endpoint} thất bại:`, error.message);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n\nexport const api = {\n  // === NHÂN SỰ ===\n  getEmployees: () => fetchApi('/employees'),\n  createEmployee: (data) => fetchApi('/employees', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(data) }),\n  toggleOnSite: (id) => fetchApi(`/employees/${id}/toggle-onsite`, { method: 'PATCH' }),\n  deleteEmployee: (id) => fetchApi(`/employees/${id}`, { method: 'DELETE' }),\n\n  // === PHÂN CÔNG & TĂNG CA ===\n  getTasks: () => fetchApi('/tasks'),\n  createTask: (data) => fetchApi('/tasks', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(data) }),\n  updateTask: (id, data) => fetchApi(`/tasks/${id}`, { method: 'PATCH', body: JSON.stringify(data) }),\n  deleteTask: (id) => fetchApi(`/tasks/${id}`, { method: 'DELETE' }),\n  createOvertime: (data) => fetchApi('/overtimes', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(data) }),\n\n  // === DỰ ÁN & TIẾN ĐỘ GANTT ===\n  getProjects: () => fetchApi('/projects'),\n  createProject: (data) => fetchApi('/projects', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(data) }),\n  getGanttItems: () => fetchApi('/gantt'),\n  createGanttItem: (data) => fetchApi('/gantt', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(data) }),\n  deleteGanttItem: (id) => fetchApi(`/gantt/${id}`, { method: 'DELETE' }),\n\n  // === THỐNG KÊ & BÁO CÁO ===\n  getStats: () => fetchApi('/stats')\n};\n","Description":"Create frontend API client with complete endpoints","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\GiaWyy\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aps-project-manager\\frontend\\src\\api.js","toolAction":"Creating API client","toolSummary":"Create api.js"}}]}
